    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yozefu kodi cipa Potifa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Joisimayili oyido jotero Yozefu i piny Misir, aka Potifa, acel kwoŋ jodhum pa Farawo m'oyido obedo jatel pa jokur ma cel pa kere am'onyewo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oyido nitie gi Yozefu, aka obedo jacwo ma kisi gimoro okidho gi go maber. Go obedo i ot pa jadwoŋ pere ma Jamisir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jadwoŋ pere oneno nike Rwoth oyido nitie gine, aka ni Rwoth omiyo kisi gima go otimo kidho maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Yozefu onwaŋo wor i waŋ Potifa, aka oketho go janeno ma ot pere to ketho go kuro kisi gim'oyido apere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i hongo ma Potifa oketho Yozefu janeno i ot pere kodi kwoŋ gim'oyido go nitie gine je, Rwoth omiyo ot pa Jamisir silwany ro Yozefu; silwany pa Rwoth oyido nikwoŋ kisi gima go oyido nitie gine, i ot kodi i ndelin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Potifa oweyo kisi gima go oyido nitie gine i cingi Yozefu aka k'odewo kwoŋ gimoro je kwanyo woko cemo ma go ocamo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Yozefu oyido ocweyere maber, aka ŋon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo hongo moro okadho, cipa jadwoŋ pere obolo waŋe kwoŋ Yozefu, aka owaco ni, “Nindi kodan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yozefu okwero to waco ni, “Neni, jadwoŋ paran kidew kwoŋ gimoro je i ot rupiri anitie ka. Go oketho kisi gim'anitie gine i cingan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anigi dwoŋ madit i ot me paka go nitie gine, aka go k'okano gimoro je kwoŋan kwanyowoko in, rupiri ibedo cege. T'onyo d'anotim kidakana madwoŋ me t'atimo reco kwoŋ Were?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka makada nende go oluwo gi Yozefu ndelo gi ndelo, k'owinjo go nindo gine, kosa bedo gine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ndelo acel, munyo Yozefu odonjo i ot timo tic pere, aka ongoye kwoŋ ŋecin ma ot m'oyido nicegin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omako go gi kanzu pere aka owaco ni, “Nindi kodan.” To Yozefu obudhere to weyo kanzu pere i cinge aka oŋweco to wok i ot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo go oneno ni go oweyo kanzu pere i cinge, aka oŋweco to wok i ot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "go olwoŋo ŋecin ma ot pere aka owaco ni, “Neni, Jayuda ma cworan okelo ka me onyo timo roro kwoŋ wan. Obino i kisika paran nindo kodan t'akoko malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo go owinjo ni atiŋo dwondan aywak, oweyo kanzu pere i cingan to ringo wok i ot.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo go okano kanzu pere gi go, cuka jadwoŋ pa Yozefu odwoko peco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo go owaco rigo wac acel ni, “Ŋeca ma Jayuda m'ikelo i dier wan, obino i kisika paran to timo roro kwoŋan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To tekin atiŋo dwondan t'aywak, go oweyo kanzu pere kabutan to ŋweco wok i ot.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jadwoŋ pere owinjo wac ma cege oluwo rigo, “Me apaka ŋeca perin oteran,” Nge pere oliel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jadwoŋ pa Yozefu otero go to ketho i jiera, kam'oyido ikan'iye jojiera pa kere; aka go obedo kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth oyido nitie gi Yozefu aka onyutho go mar makiwire, aka omiyo go wor i waŋ jakur jiera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jakur jiera omiyo Yozefu kuro jojiera man je, aka kisi gim'otimi kenyo go am'oyido jatim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakur jiera doko k'okuro gimoro je ma Yozefu oyido kuro rupiri Rwoth oyido nitie gi go, aka kisi gima go otimo, Rwoth omiyo kidho maber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
